`yaml_body` takes the text of one object, as YAML or JSON. A key that appears twice in one mapping is an error. A plan shows a change to the text line by line. When another client changes a field, the plan lists the field in `drift` and does not show its value, because the text may hold sensitive values. Set `manifest` instead to see the changed values in the plan, to mark single values as sensitive, or to use values that are not known until apply without making the whole manifest unknown.

